      "version_introduced": "1.0.0",
      "status": "ACTIVE",
      "normative_text": "Silent deletion or silent replacement of normative rules, schemas, or governing-manifest entries is prohibited. Removal from active effect requires SUPERSEDED, DEPRECATED, or RETIRED status with lineage.",
